OL,3,GNEWSATheft of church's saint statue
OL,4,A'bizarre' - vicar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vicar has described the theft of a
OL,7,F99-year-old statue of St Cuthbert as
OL,8,F"bizarre" after the item was taken from
OL,9,Fa church in West Yorkshire.
OL,11,FThe 2ft (60cm) statue of the
OL,12,FNorthumbrian saint was stolen from St
OL,13,FMary's in Oxenhope sometime between
OL,14,F09:00 BST on 31 August and 17:00 on 1
OL,15,FSeptember, according to the Reverend
OL,16,FDenise Hayes.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
