OL,3,GNEWSATheft of church's saint statue
OL,4,A'bizarre' - vicar
OL,5,
OL,6,FRev Hayes, who has been at the parish
OL,7,Ffor 18 months and was previously a
OL,8,Fchaplain at HMP New Hall in Wakefield,
OL,9,Fsaid she had not expected to be
OL,10,Fimpacted by crime at the Oxenhope
OL,11,Fchurch.
OL,13,F"It's just the most bizarre thing I've
OL,14,Fever dealt with, because I just can't
OL,15,Funderstand," she said.
